        "visual_keywords": "snowy farmstead winter"
      },
      {
        "narration": "Keys vanished. A strange newspaper appeared. That night, heavy steps creaked directly above their beds.",
        "visual_keywords": "dark wooden attic"
      },
      {
        "narration": "How long would you sleep beneath a killer's floorboards before you noticed?",
        "visual_keywords": "candle dark room"
      },
      {
        "narration": "All six family members were lured to the barn and slaughtered. Yet for days after, smoke still rose from the chimney.",
        "visual_keywords": "old desolate barn"
      },
      {
        "narration": "The murderer fed the cattle, slept in their beds, and ate their food\u2014leaving six cold bodies in the dark.",
